<title>UK: SBC sets warrants on German chemical basket.</title>
<headline>SBC sets warrants on German chemical basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schweizerischer Bankverein AG said it has issued two million American-style call warrants, in two equal tranches, on a German chemical basket.</p>
<p>The basket includes 10 shares each of BASF AG, Bayer AG and Hoechst AG.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 10.DEC.96-01.JUL.97   PAYDATE	09.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFURT, DUSS	     MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p>* * * * * * * * *</p>
<p> TYPE	  STRIKE	 ISSUE	PREMIUM	GEARING</p>
<p> CALL	  1900 DEM     14.13 DEM  5.7 PCT	13.7 X</p>
<p> CALL	  2000 DEM     8.74 DEM   8.0 PCT	22.1 X</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
